  "description": "Testimize is a smart and scalable test data generation engine for .NET. It supports boundary value analysis, pairwise testing, and heuristic optimization via the Artificial Bee Colony (ABC) algorithm. Designed for CI/CD, exploratory testing, and validation scenarios.",
